    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Background] </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Birmingham, England, 1939. In this game, you'll play as a lady seeking vengeance for her deceased gangster husband. We are committed to recreating classic scenes of the 1930s British gangland, immersing players in this dark world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Key Features] </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Superior Graphics: From character costumes to meticulously researched scene props, we strive to recreate an authentic 1939 British gangland world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense Combat: Fast-paced, visceral combat with impactful feedback. Enemies fall like wheat one moment, and death could come the next. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Weaponry: You'll encounter enemies wielding various weapons, all of which can be acquired and used. Both melee and ranged weapons are carefully designed with unique characteristics. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Strategy: Various level designs and enemy AI behaviours allow for multiple approaches to tackle each challenge. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;When the bullet of vengeance is chambered, the whole world holds its breath.&quot; Do you dare to dance this deadly tango on a tightrope?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Game Background] </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Birmingham, England, 1939. In this game, you'll play as a lady seeking vengeance for her deceased gangster husband. We are committed to recreating classic scenes of the 1930s British gangland, immersing players in this dark world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Key Features] </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Superior Graphics: From character costumes to meticulously researched scene props, we strive to recreate an authentic 1939 British gangland world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense Combat: Fast-paced, visceral combat with impactful feedback. Enemies fall like wheat one moment, and death could come the next. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Weaponry: You'll encounter enemies wielding various weapons, all of which can be acquired and used. Both melee and ranged weapons are carefully designed with unique characteristics. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Strategy: Various level designs and enemy AI behaviours allow for multiple approaches to tackle each challenge. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;When the bullet of vengeance is chambered, the whole world holds its breath.&quot; Do you dare to dance this deadly tango on a tightrope?</p>",
